('APX-S-4458-1', 'APX-C-4458', 1, null, null, null, 'Cinematic 15-second racing film set at a professional circuit with Mount Fuji towering in the distant background at golden hour, gradually transitioning into a dramatic dusk atmosphere. The video consists of 15 rapid one-second shots with clean cuts and smooth visual flow. Ultra-realistic racing environment with detailed asphalt textures, tire marks, heat haze, and high-performance vehicle design. The red race car features aggressive aerodynamic styling, sponsor decals, and reflective surfaces.', null, null, '15-second racing film set at a professional circuit with Mount Fuji towering in the distant background at golden hour, gradually transitioning into a dramatic dusk atmosphere.', null, 'racing', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4458-2', 'APX-C-4458', 2, null, null, null, 'The orange cat driver wears a gray racing suit covered in brand logos, exuding confidence and focus. Warm golden sunlight shifts into deeper cinematic tones, while bold Nike-style typography is embedded into the environment and motion. High-end commercial automotive cinematography style, consistent across all shots. Shot List Sequence: 1. Aerial establishing shot of the racetrack with Mount Fuji in the distance, crowds gathering. Oversized faint typography embedded in the landscape: “DARE”.', null, null, 'The orange cat driver wears a gray racing suit covered in brand logos, exuding confidence and focus. Warm golden sunlight shifts into deeper tones, while bold Nike-style typography is embedded into the environment and motion.', 'driver', 'racing', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4458-3', 'APX-C-4458', 3, null, null, null, '2. Camera slowly forward glide through the pit lane — Gray cats in mechanic jumpsuits cheer loudly as the orange cat walks confidently toward a red race car. 3. Medium hero shot — the orange cat pauses beside the car, wind subtly moving fabric. Massive typography behind: “COURAGE”. 4. Close-up of the orange cat’s face — determined eyes, subtle sweat, reflected track lights. Micro-text overlays flicker across reflections. 5. Low-angle shot of the car door opening. The orange cat steps in.', null, null, 'Camera slowly forward glide through the pit lane — Gray cats in mechanic jumpsuits cheer loudly as the orange cat walks confidently toward a race car. Medium hero shot — the orange cat pauses beside the car, wind subtly moving fabric.', 'animal-character', null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4458-4', 'APX-C-4458', 4, null, null, null, 'Text stretches along the ground perspective: “STEP IN”. 6. Interior cockpit POV — hands gripping the steering wheel, dashboard lights flicker to life. Minimal UI text: “FOCUS”. 7. Engine ignition — tight macro shot of vibration and revs. Typography pulses with the sound: “IGNITE”. 8. Hard cut to race start — multiple race cars launch forward. Tire smoke blends with fragmented kinetic text: “GO ALL IN”. 9. High-speed tracking shot alongside the red car. Motion blur streaks across the frame, elongated typography flows with speed: “NO LIMIT”.', null, null, 'Text stretches along the ground perspective: “STEP IN”. Interior cockpit POV — hands gripping the steering wheel, dashboard lights flicker to life. Minimal UI text: “FOCUS”. Engine ignition — of vibration and revs.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4458-5', 'APX-C-4458', 5, null, null, null, '10. Near-collision moment — razor-thin overtake. Camera shakes slightly. Text fractures dynamically: “RISK”. 11. Interior POV again — heavy breathing, intense steering corrections. Reflections of competitors flash across the visor. Subtle overlay: “HOLD”. 12. Wide cinematic shot — the red car drifts through a corner with Mount Fuji glowing in dusk light. Typography arcs across the sky: “CHASE THE DREAM”. 13. Final straight sprint — engine screaming, camera low and aggressive. Bold text embedded into track lines: “NEVER BACK DOWN”.', null, null, 'Near-collision moment — razor-thin overtake. Text fractures dynamically: “RISK”. Interior POV again — heavy breathing, intense steering corrections. Reflections of competitors flash across the visor.', null, 'sprinting', null, null, null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-4458-6', 'APX-C-4458', 6, null, null, null, '14. Finish line crossing — explosive moment. Lights flare. Typography locks hard: “VICTORY”. 15. Final hero shot — the orange cat leans against the red race car, holding a large trophy. One arm wraps around a white cat wearing a pink short dress. Around them, cheering animal fans in casual outfit', null, null, 'Finish line crossing — explosive moment. Typography locks hard: “VICTORY”. Final hero shot — the orange cat leans against the race car, holding a large trophy. One arm wraps around a white cat wearing a pink short dress.', 'animal-character', null, null, null, null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-4431-1', 'APX-C-4431', 1, 0, 2, 2, null, 230, 293, 'Wide of the full Space Shuttle stack (white orbiter with black heat tiles, massive orange external tank, two white SRBs) standing vertically on the launch pad next to the tall metal tower under a deep dark blue night sky.', null, null, null, null, 'tower', 'calm'),
('APX-S-4431-2', 'APX-C-4431', 2, 2, 4, 2, null, 535, 408, 'Sudden violent ignition — three main engines and two SRBs fire simultaneously with blinding orange-white flames and explosive clouds of thick white smoke + steam from the water deluge system erupting from the base.', null, null, null, null, null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-4431-3', 'APX-C-4431', 3, 4, 6, 2, null, 955, 297, 'Extreme low-angle close-up on the engines and lower orbiter/external tank as the flames intensify and massive billowing smoke clouds swirl and expand violently upward, thick white vapor pouring out, intense heat distortion, orange…', null, 'pouring', null, null, null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-4431-4', 'APX-C-4431', 4, 6, 8, 2, null, 1264, 244, 'Camera pulls back to medium-wide as the shuttle begins to slowly lift off the pad; enormous golden-orange fire and expanding smoke clouds engulf the launch tower base, brilliant reflections on the wet ground, raw power visible.', null, null, null, null, 'tower', null),
('APX-S-4431-5', 'APX-C-4431', 5, 8, 10, 2, null, 1521, 270, 'Dramatic of the Space Shuttle clearing the tower and rising majestically into the night sky; massive expanding clouds of fire and thick white/orange smoke billow outward across the entire pad, tower lit dramatically by the engine glow…', null, null, null, null, 'tower', 'epic'),
('APX-S-4431-6', 'APX-C-4431', 6, 10, 12, 2, null, 1805, 248, 'Dynamic shot from below the ascending shuttle, focusing on the three blazing engine nozzles and SRBs producing powerful blue-white exhaust plumes, smoke continuing to surge upward, shuttle gaining altitude against the dark sky.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
