('APX-S-4446-1', 'APX-C-4446', 1, null, null, null, '(0s–4s) A peaceful afternoon inside a warm sunlit room. The girl sits near a large window while soft sunlight pours across the floor. A fluffy orange cat slowly walks toward her. She notices the cat and smiles gently. The cat rubs against her hand as she softly pets its head. Floating dust particles glow in the sunlight creating a dreamy atmosphere.', null, null, 'The girl sits near a large window while soft sunlight pours across the floor. A fluffy orange cat slowly walks toward her. She notices the cat and smiles gently. The cat rubs against her hand as she softly pets its head.', 'animal-character', 'pouring', null, null, null, 'calm'),
('APX-S-4446-2', 'APX-C-4446', 2, null, null, null, 'Camera: slow cinematic dolly-in, soft focus background, close-up shots of hands touching fur Mood: calm, heartwarming, peaceful (4s–8s) The girl plays with the cat using a small ribbon toy. The cat jumps around energetically across the wooden floor while she laughs naturally. Her hair moves softly as she leans forward chasing the cat playfully.', null, null, 'The cat jumps around energetically across the wooden floor while she laughs naturally. Her hair moves softly as she leans forward chasing the cat playfully.', 'animal-character', 'leaping', null, null, null, 'playful'),
('APX-S-4446-3', 'APX-C-4446', 3, null, null, null, 'The cat suddenly runs across the couch and she follows while smiling brightly. Camera: handheld cinematic movement mixed with slow motion cat jumps Mood: lively, joyful, genuine connection. (8s–12s) The energy slows down. The girl lies on the floor beside the cat while the cat curls near her shoulder.', null, null, 'The cat suddenly runs across the couch and she follows while smiling brightly. The girl lies on the floor beside the cat while the cat curls near her shoulder.', 'animal-character', 'sprinting; leaping', null, null, null, 'playful'),
('APX-S-4446-4', 'APX-C-4446', 4, null, null, null, 'She gently scratches under its chin while looking at it lovingly. The cat closes its eyes peacefully. Warm sunset light fills the room with orange and golden tones. Camera: intimate close-ups, soft side profile shots, shallow depth of field Mood: emotional, comforting, soft cinematic warmth.', null, null, 'She gently scratches under its chin while looking at it lovingly.', 'animal-character', null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-4446-5', 'APX-C-4446', 5, null, null, null, '(12s–16s) The girl carries the cat toward the window while city lights begin glowing outside during blue hour. The cat rests calmly in her arms. She looks outside, then toward the camera with a soft smile. Final cinematic freeze-frame feeling as the cat lightly touches her cheek with its paw.', null, null, '(12s–16s) The girl carries the cat toward the window while city lights begin glowing outside during blue hour. The cat rests calmly in her arms. She looks outside, then toward the camera with a soft smile.', 'animal-character', null, null, null, null, null),
